      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON ALARM (8) is a handy type who notched his 4th career success when too good (19.60) from Box 5 at this track. The form out of his last race has been franked. Can continue on his winning ways. BANJO'S CLANCY (2) turned in a solid run last start over 300m at Q Straight finishing 5th and beaten only 2.25 lengths (16.79). Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. TRAVELLING DEAN (7) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (22.30) in a P5 at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Must be included in calculations. LITTLE HOUSE (6) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
